Algorithm
1) Start.
2) Read the number of rides.
3) Read the ride type and distance.
4) Select the vehicle: Bike, Auto, or Cab.
6) Calculate fare based on the distance.
7) If the distance or ride type is invalid, print "Invalid Booking".
8) Print the fare.
9) Stop.
